<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<subsection xml:id="course_description" label="course_description" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Course Description</title>
  <p>
    This course will utilize the logical foundation and proof techniques developed in pre-requisite courses to explore the basic constructions in modern algebra: rings, modules, and groups.
  </p>
</subsection>
